\p \w And as Gehazi left|strong="H3318"\w* \w his presence|strong="H6440"\w*, \w he was leprous|strong="H6879"\w*— \w as white as snow|strong="H7950"\w*.
\c 6
\s1 The Axe Head Floats
\p \v 1 \w Now the sons|strong="H1121"\w* \w of the prophets|strong="H5030"\w* \w said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w Elisha|strong="H477"\w*, “\w Please|strong="H4994"\w* \w take note|strong="H2009"\w* \w that the place|strong="H4725"\w* \w where|strong="H834"\w* \w we|strong="H587"\w* \w meet|strong="H3427"\w* \w with you|strong="H6440"\w* \w is too small|strong="H6862"\w* \w for us|strong="H4480"\w*. \v 2 \w Please|strong="H4994"\w* \w let us go|strong="H1980"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w the Jordan|strong="H3383"\w*, \w where|strong="H8033"\w* \w each of us|strong="H376"\w* \w can get|strong="H3947"\w* \w a|strong="H259"\w* \w log|strong="H6982"\w* \w so we can build|strong="H6213"\w* ourselves \w a place|strong="H4725"\w* \w to live|strong="H3427"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w*.”
