\p \w And when he showed|strong="H7200"\w* \w him|strong="H853"\w* \w the place|strong="H4725"\w*, \w the man of God cut|strong="H7094"\w* \w a stick|strong="H6086"\w*, \w threw|strong="H7993"\w* \w it there|strong="H8033"\w*, \w and made the iron|strong="H1270"\w* \w float|strong="H6687"\w*.
\p \v 7 “\w Lift it out|strong="H7311"\w*,” \w he said|strong="H559"\w*, \w and the man reached out|strong="H7971"\w* \w his hand|strong="H3027"\w* \w and took it|strong="H3947"\w*.
\s1 Elisha Captures the Blinded Arameans
\p \v 8 \w Now the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Aram|strong="H758"\w* \w was|strong="H1961"\w* \w at war|strong="H3898"\w* \w against Israel|strong="H3478"\w*. \w After consulting|strong="H3289"\w* \w with|strong="H413"\w* \w his servants|strong="H5650"\w*, \w he said|strong="H559"\w*, “\w My camp will be|strong="H8466"\w* \w in|strong="H413"\w* \w such|strong="H6423"\w* \w and such|strong="H492"\w* \w a place|strong="H4725"\w*.”
\p \v 9 \w Then the man|strong="H376"\w* \w of God|strong="H430"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w word to|strong="H413"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*: “\w Be careful not|strong="H8104"\w* \w to pass by|strong="H5674"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w place|strong="H4725"\w*, \w for|strong="H3588"\w* \w the Arameans|strong="H758"\w* \w are going down|strong="H5185"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w*.”
\p \v 10 \w So the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w sent|strong="H7971"\w* \w word to|strong="H413"\w* \w the place|strong="H4725"\w* \w the man|strong="H376"\w* \w of God|strong="H430"\w* \w had pointed out|strong="H559"\w*. \w Time and again|strong="H259"\w*\f + \fr 6:10 \ft Literally \fqa Not once and not twice\f* \w Elisha warned the king|strong="H2094"\w*, \w so that he was on his guard|strong="H8104"\w* \w in such places|strong="H8033"\w*. \v 11 \w For|strong="H5921"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w reason|strong="H1697"\w* \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Aram|strong="H758"\w* \w became enraged|strong="H5590"\w* \w and called|strong="H7121"\w* \w his servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w to demand|strong="H559"\w* \w of them|strong="H413"\w*, “\w Tell me|strong="H5046"\w*, \w which one|strong="H4310"\w* of us \w is on the side|strong="H413"\w* \w of the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w*?”
