\s1 The Siege and Famine of Samaria
\p \v 24 \w Some time later|strong="H310"\w*, \w Ben-hadad|strong="H1130"\w* \w king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Aram|strong="H758"\w* \w assembled|strong="H6908"\w* \w his entire|strong="H3605"\w* \w army|strong="H4264"\w* \w and marched up|strong="H5927"\w* \w to besiege|strong="H6696"\w* \w Samaria|strong="H8111"\w*.
