\s1 The Arameans Flee
\p \v 3 \w Now there were|strong="H1961"\w* \w four|strong="H702"\w* \w men|strong="H582"\w* \w with leprosy|strong="H6879"\w*\f + \fr 7:3 \fqa Leprosy \ft was a term used for various skin diseases; here and in verse 8; see Leviticus 13.\f* \w at the entrance|strong="H6607"\w* \w of the city gate|strong="H8179"\w*, \w and they said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w one|strong="H376"\w* \w another|strong="H7453"\w*, “\w Why|strong="H4100"\w* \w just sit|strong="H3427"\w* \w here|strong="H6311"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w we die|strong="H4191"\w*? \v 4 \w If|strong="H518"\w* \w we say|strong="H559"\w*, ‘\w Let us go into|strong="H935"\w* \w the city|strong="H5892"\w*,’ \w we will die|strong="H4191"\w* \w there|strong="H8033"\w* \w from the famine|strong="H7458"\w* \w in the city|strong="H5892"\w*; \w but if|strong="H518"\w* \w we sit|strong="H3427"\w* \w here|strong="H6311"\w*, \w we will also die|strong="H4191"\w*. \w So come|strong="H1980"\w* \w now|strong="H6258"\w*, \w let us go over|strong="H5307"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the camp|strong="H4264"\w* \w of the Arameans|strong="H758"\w*. \w If|strong="H518"\w* \w they let us live|strong="H2421"\w*, \w we will live|strong="H2421"\w*; \w if|strong="H518"\w* \w they kill us|strong="H4191"\w*, \w we will die|strong="H4191"\w*.”
\p \v 5 \w So they arose|strong="H6965"\w* \w at twilight|strong="H5399"\w* \w and went|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w the camp|strong="H4264"\w* \w of the Arameans|strong="H758"\w*. \w But when they came|strong="H935"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w the outskirts|strong="H7097"\w* \w of the camp|strong="H4264"\w*, \w there was not|strong="H369"\w* \w a man|strong="H376"\w* \w to be found|strong="H2009"\w*. \v 6 \w For the Lord|strong="H136"\w* \w had caused the Arameans|strong="H758"\w* \w to hear|strong="H8085"\w* \w the sound|strong="H6963"\w* \w of chariots|strong="H7393"\w*, \w horses|strong="H5483"\w*, \w and a great|strong="H1419"\w* \w army|strong="H2428"\w*, \w so that they said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w one|strong="H376"\w* \w another|strong="H251"\w*, “\w Look|strong="H2009"\w*, \w the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w must have hired|strong="H7936"\w* \w the kings|strong="H4428"\w* \w of the Hittites|strong="H2850"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w Egyptians|strong="H4714"\w* \w to attack|strong="H935"\w* \w us|strong="H5921"\w*.”
\p \v 7 \w Thus the Arameans had arisen|strong="H6965"\w* \w and fled|strong="H5127"\w* \w at twilight|strong="H5399"\w*, \w abandoning|strong="H5800"\w* \w their tents|strong="H168"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w horses|strong="H5483"\w* \w and|strong="H853"\w* \w donkeys|strong="H2543"\w*. \w The camp was intact|strong="H4264"\w*, \w and they had run|strong="H5127"\w* \w for|strong="H413"\w* \w their lives|strong="H5315"\w*.
\p \v 8 \w When the|strong="H428"\w* \w lepers|strong="H6879"\w* \w reached|strong="H935"\w* \w the edge|strong="H7097"\w* \w of the camp|strong="H4264"\w*, \w they went|strong="H935"\w* \w into|strong="H413"\w* \w a|strong="H259"\w* \w tent|strong="H168"\w* \w to eat|strong="H398"\w* \w and drink|strong="H8354"\w*. \w Then they carried off|strong="H5375"\w* \w the silver|strong="H3701"\w*, \w gold|strong="H2091"\w*, \w and clothing|strong="H899"\w*, \w and went|strong="H1980"\w* \w and hid them|strong="H2934"\w*. \w On returning|strong="H7725"\w*, \w they entered|strong="H935"\w* \w another|strong="H312"\w* \w tent|strong="H168"\w*, \w carried off some items|strong="H5375"\w* \w from there|strong="H8033"\w*, \w and hid them|strong="H2934"\w*.
\p \v 9 \w Finally, they said|strong="H559"\w* \w to|strong="H413"\w* \w one|strong="H376"\w* \w another|strong="H7453"\w*, “\w We are|strong="H587"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w doing|strong="H6213"\w* \w what is right|strong="H3651"\w*. \w Today|strong="H3117"\w* \w is a day|strong="H3117"\w* \w of good news|strong="H1309"\w*. \w If we|strong="H587"\w* \w are silent|strong="H2814"\w* \w and wait|strong="H2442"\w* \w until|strong="H5704"\w* \w morning|strong="H1242"\w* \w light|strong="H216"\w*, \w our sin|strong="H5771"\w* \w will overtake us|strong="H4672"\w*. \w Now, therefore|strong="H6258"\w*, \w let us go|strong="H935"\w* \w and tell|strong="H5046"\w* \w the king’s|strong="H4428"\w* \w household|strong="H1004"\w*.”
