\s1 Israel Carried Captive to Assyria
\p \v 5 \w Then the king|strong="H4428"\w* \w of Assyria|strong="H804"\w* \w invaded|strong="H5927"\w* \w the whole|strong="H3605"\w* \w land|strong="H776"\w*, \w marched up|strong="H5927"\w* \w to Samaria|strong="H8111"\w*, \w and besieged|strong="H6696"\w* \w it|strong="H5921"\w* \w for three|strong="H7969"\w* \w years|strong="H8141"\w*.
