\p \v 9 \w The Israelites|strong="H1121"\w* \w secretly did|strong="H2644"\w* \w things against|strong="H5921"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w their God|strong="H430"\w* \w that were|strong="H834"\w* \w not|strong="H3808"\w* \w right|strong="H3651"\w*. \w From watchtower|strong="H4026"\w* \w to|strong="H5704"\w* \w fortified|strong="H4013"\w* \w city|strong="H5892"\w*, \w they built|strong="H1129"\w* \w high places|strong="H1116"\w* \w in all|strong="H3605"\w* \w their cities|strong="H5892"\w*. \v 10 \w They set up|strong="H5324"\w* for themselves \w sacred pillars|strong="H4676"\w* \w and Asherah poles|strong="H842"\w* \w on|strong="H5921"\w* \w every|strong="H3605"\w* \w high|strong="H1364"\w* \w hill|strong="H1389"\w* \w and under|strong="H8478"\w* \w every|strong="H3605"\w* \w green|strong="H7488"\w* \w tree|strong="H6086"\w*. \v 11 \w They burned incense|strong="H6999"\w* \w on all|strong="H3605"\w* \w the high places|strong="H1116"\w* \w like the nations|strong="H1471"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had driven out|strong="H1540"\w* \w before them|strong="H6440"\w*. \w They did|strong="H6213"\w* \w wicked|strong="H7451"\w* \w things|strong="H1697"\w*, \w provoking|strong="H3707"\w* \w the LORD to anger|strong="H3068"\w*. \v 12 \w They served|strong="H5647"\w* \w idols|strong="H1544"\w*, \w although the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w had told|strong="H559"\w* them, “\w You shall not|strong="H3808"\w* \w do|strong="H6213"\w* \w this|strong="H2088"\w* \w thing|strong="H1697"\w*.”\f + \fr 17:12 \ft \ref Exodus 20:4–6|EXO 20:4-6\ref*; Deuteronomy 5:8–10\f*
\p \v 13 \w Yet through|strong="H3027"\w* \w all|strong="H3605"\w* \w His prophets|strong="H5030"\w* \w and|strong="H3605"\w* \w seers|strong="H2374"\w*, \w the LORD|strong="H3068"\w* \w warned|strong="H5749"\w* \w Israel|strong="H3478"\w* \w and Judah|strong="H3063"\w*, \w saying|strong="H559"\w*, “\w Turn|strong="H7725"\w* \w from your wicked|strong="H7451"\w* \w ways|strong="H1870"\w* \w and keep|strong="H8104"\w* \w My commandments|strong="H4687"\w* \w and statutes|strong="H2708"\w*, \w according to the entire|strong="H3605"\w* \w Law|strong="H8451"\w* \w that|strong="H834"\w* \w I commanded|strong="H6680"\w* \w your fathers|strong="H1"\w* \w and delivered|strong="H7971"\w* \w to you|strong="H413"\w* \w through|strong="H3027"\w* \w My servants|strong="H5650"\w* \w the prophets|strong="H5030"\w*.”
